  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe given expression = 1(1)/(8)÷1(4)/(5) of [3(1)/(4)-((14)/(25)+(2)/(5)×2(4)/(5)÷(5)/(3) of (7)/(15)) ]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n 1(1)/(8)÷1(4)/(5) of [3(1)/(4)-((14)/(25)+(2)/(5)×2(4)/(5)÷(5)/(3) of (7)/(15)) ]\n\n= (9)/(8)÷(9)/(5)of[(13)/(4)-((14)/(25)+(2)/(5)×(14)/(5)÷(7)/(9))]\n\n= (9)/(8)÷(9)/(5)of[(13)/(4)-((14)/(25)+(2)/(5)×(14)/(5)×(9)/(7))]\n\n= (9)/(8)÷(9)/(5)of[(13)/(4)-((14)/(25)+(36)/(25))]\n\n= 9/8 ÷ 9/5 of [13/4 - 2]\n\n= 9/8 ÷ 9/5 × 5/4\n\n= 9/8 ÷ 9/4\n\n= 9/8 × 4/9\n\n= 1/2\n\n**∴ The value of the expression is 1/2**\n\nbd:T600,\n&l",
